    "notes": "FCF CAGRs are owner basis (OCF - capex - manager fees in units - finance income). Owner and reported FCF CAGRs are almost identical: fees-in-units have been a stable ~2% of revenue. FY2021 base year is the COVID trough (DPU 9.49c incl. released retentions)."
