    "share_count_basis": "Units in issue and to be issued at 31 Mar 2026 (5,284,370k; N2IU.SI_Annual_FY2026.txt:542). Held flat: the units issued for manager fees are charged as an expense in the flows (sbc_pct_path), so growing the count too would double-count.",
    "last_fcf_basis": "Owner AFFO FY26 = amount available for distribution to Unitholders 421.38 - manager fees paid in units 17.93 - maintenance capex at 4.5% of revenue 39.03 = 364.42. Distributable income is already after finance costs, tax and perpetual-securities distributions, so it is capitalised at the cost of equity with net debt held at zero.",
    "wacc_rationale": "Cost of equity in SGD (flows are SGD-reported; overseas HK/China/Japan/Korea income is translated and largely hedged). SGS 10y ~2.3% + ERP 5.0% x beta ~0.9 + ~0.2% for the North Asia exposure (HK Festival Walk, Beijing/Shanghai offices) = ~7.0% base. Bull 6.5%, bear 7.75%. This is a cost of equity, not a WACC, because the stream is post-interest.",
